frameStoreT -- Topics/forms G3 item 2 inside the cheat (stroke 3b, SEQ 729; Tony ruled 2026-11-21). Includes
IncantForms/WorkingOn/cheat, whose setFrame reads formFrames, so every row here measures the cheat; at the buy (3c) the
include is dropped and the same rows must stay green against utilities.

The mock window is flWin, the frame firstLight's window is at: an open or a redraw sets it from the laid-out copy, a resize
sets it to the new frame. The events: mockOpen (a plain open, redrawForm with no frame), mockResize (the window takes the
new frame, then redrawWindow), mockClose (keepFrame with the window's frame), mockClickShow (click, then redrawWindow).
All draw to IncantForms/PDF/test.pdf, not output.pdf.

S1  a plain open with no entry: declared, 500x600 at 300,450.
S2  resize to 1200x800: the frame comes from the store; inside (height=60%) is 480.
S3  resize to 900x500 at 100,100: inside is 300 -- a percent is right after two resizes.
S4  close: the window's frame (900x500 at 100,100) is kept.
S5  reopen: from the store, 900x500 at 100,100 -- a resize then a reopen keeps the size.
S6  click redraw (the click swaps inside to okNote): the window's frame is kept first, so 900x500 again.
S7  close firstLight, open descriptions: descriptions opens at its declared 500x600 at 500,200, not firstLight's.
S8  reopen firstLight: its entry was untouched by descriptions, 900x500 at 100,100.
S9  open again with no event: S8's read cleared the entry, so declared.
S10 an entry with only a width (700): width from the store, x y height declared.
